---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { videoChannels } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout current="videos" title="视频作品 · 劳伦斯在上海" description="视频作品：B站长视频与小红书短视频、图文卡片、创作过程。">
  <main id="content" class="page">
    <section class="page-title">
      <h1>视频作品</h1>
      <p>同一批作品会被重新剪成不同形态：B站适合完整讲解，小红书适合短节奏表达和封面卡片。</p>
    </section>
    <section class="section">
      <div class="screening-room">
        <div class="screening-visual" aria-hidden="true">
          <span></span>
          <span></span>
          <span></span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2>放映厅</h2>
          <p>视频区不追求频道大全，只保留最重要的观看入口和内容气质。后续每个系列可以继续补封面、脚本和成片链接。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="channel-grid">
        {videoChannels.map((channel) => (
          <article class="channel-card">
            <span class="meta">{channel.platform}</span>
            <h3>{channel.handle}</h3>
            <p>{channel.tone}</p>
            {channel.href ? (
              <a class="button primary" href={channel.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{channel.cta}</a>
            ) : (
              <span class="button">{channel.cta}</span>
            )}
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
